      "id": "coreunit",
      "kind": "service",
      "label": "crv-core-vllm-27b-w8a16.service",
      "sublabel": "Type=exec · never enabled · Restart=no · TimeoutStartSec=900",
      "note": "Never enable this unit: a Core that loads at boot defeats idle parking. Restart=no is deliberate — the park watchdog stops it, and a restart policy would undo that.\n\nType=exec calls the unit active as soon as the process spawns, but vLLM binds its port minutes later, so ExecStartPost polls :18041 (and $MAINPID, so a crash fails fast) for up to 880 s.",
