      "id": "launcher",
      "kind": "program",
      "label": "start_qwen_tp4.sh",
      "sublabel": "in Gpu-Rig, NOT this repo · shared by both TP=4 profiles",
      "note": "Lives OUTSIDE this repo, in Gpu-Rig. Translates the profile's env into vLLM flags. KV=fp8 → --kv-cache-dtype fp8 (which IS fp8_e4m3 on CUDA); KV=bf16 would switch to FLASH_ATTN + the split-KV spec-decode patch instead. Always passes --reasoning-parser qwen3, without which the whole thinking block lands in message.content.",
