      "sublabel": "backend :18041 · 262,144 ctx · fp8 KV · vision · MTP drafts · prefix cache ON",
      "note": "Measured 2026-09-04: 7.49 GiB of weights per rank, 12.72 GiB left for KV = 1,493,666 tokens, 5.70x concurrency at the full 262k window. ~164 tok/s decode. Vision tower loads with an 8192-token encoder budget.",
      "frame": "engine",
